{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/671627-khaibit-and-obtenebration","id":671627,"title":"Khaibit and Obtenebration","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-19T20:06:25-07:00","id":671627,"title":"Khaibit and Obtenebration","content":"So using Ba, a Khaibit becomes a nearly invulnerable shadow, and can still use pseshkf, does this mean she can use Tyet to control pseshkf coated objects while a shadow? For example if she coated a pistol in pseshkf and used Tyet before assuming Ba form, would she be able to fire the pistol?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/460-rani-neferet","name":"Rani Neferet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar460_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"971"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-20T00:01:18-07:00","id":671694,"title":"","content":"I don't see why not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1526-diggs","name":"Diggs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-20T01:41:27-07:00","id":671723,"title":"","content":"Yes but I don't think the bullets would inflict extra damage or be that good against spirits/striges, since it's the gun that's covered in palpable darkness. It's still a very neat trick though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1866-ophion","name":"Ophion","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-20T03:18:21-07:00","id":671769,"title":"","content":"Yes, you could. Khaibit are scary that way. Of course, your neigh invulnerable shadow is still weak to things like Majesty and Cruac/Theban, so its not like you're really that invincible. Resilience laughs off your shadow-controlled gun's damage. A vigor-vampire can still grab that gun and break it, rendering it useless. Celerity outpaces the shadow. The three physicals end up with a stalemate, the three mind-control powers beat it, obfuscate and protean stalemate (unless protean claws hurt ephemeral beings, at which point it wins). Even high level Animalism (4+) can have power over someone in Ba form, and Auspex 4 (telepathy) can theoretically trick a Khaibit by putting the right thoughts into their head. And, of course, any vampire can pick up a moltov. Which, on top of the extra damage from being in Ba form, means that its very easy for you to die from something most other vampires find annoying. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-20T08:34:54-07:00","id":672011,"title":"","content":"Thanks everyone.<br /> <br /> I'm currently playing a rather bad apple young kindred who has some spiritual enemy that she has lost track of. Basically building up a mortal powerbase in criminal dealings to track said creature down as well as deal with her more mortal aspirations. The thought was mainly against larger groups of humans (rival gangs and such).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":460,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/460-rani-neferet","user":"Rani Neferet","date":". 09-20-2015, 11:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/460-rani-neferet","name":"Rani Neferet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar460_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"971"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}